    551	**Why novel:** S127's joint (alpha-bilinear) ILP returned UNKNOWN on every random `(W ≥ 4, M=3)` cell within 600 s. The cross-encoding shift (column-enum) eliminates the bilinear constraints and resolves the M=3 cells in 147–230 s.
